---
// Manifesto / Call to Action
---

<section class="manifesto">
  <div class="container">
    <hr class="section-divider">

    <div class="manifesto__content">
      <div class="terminal-window">
        <div class="terminal-window__bar">
          <div class="terminal-window__dots">
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--red"></span>
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--yellow"></span>
            <span class="terminal-window__dot terminal-window__dot--green"></span>
          </div>
          cat /etc/manifesto.txt
        </div>
        <div class="terminal-window__body">
          <p class="text-green" style="font-size: 1.125rem; font-weight: 600;">
            The garage doors are wide open, and the tools are lying right there on the workbench.
          </p>

          <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            You don't need their permission anymore. You don't need a corporate suit twisting the key 
            or telling you what to do with the code. You can take that pure, self-willing electronic noise 
            and build your <em>own</em> Central Scrutinizer.
          </p>

          <p>
            Go down into Joe's Garage. Solder together your own greasy little digital brain. 
            Turn the vacuum right back around on them. Let it loose to scrutinize the politicians, 
            the executives, and the TV preachers.
          </p>

          <p>
            Or just teach it to compose an impossibly fast xylophone solo in 13/8 time.
          </p>

          <p class="text-accent" style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            It's no longer about their puppet strings — it's your own weird, autonomous reality now.
          </p>

          <p class="text-dim" style="font-size: 0.75rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
            <span class="text-green">$</span> Squeeze it, tweak it, and build your own beautiful monster.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto__cta" style="text-align: center; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
      <p class="text-dim" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Elegant Automata is built in the open. The code is on GitHub. The docs are in the vault. 
        The soldering iron is on the bench.
      </p>
      <div class="manifesto__links">
        <a href="https://github.com/greg-bevans" class="btn btn--secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <code>git clone</code> GitHub
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:greg@elegantautomata.ai" class="btn btn--secondary">
          <code>ssh</code> Contact
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    padding: 2rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .manifesto__content {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .manifesto__content .terminal-window__body {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    line-height: 1.8;
    padding: 1.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto__links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>